<title>ARGENTINA: ADVISORY - Argentine markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Argentine markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's banks and financial markets are closed Monday for a national holiday, the Day of Affirmation of Sovereignty Rights over the Malvinas (Falklands) Islands.</p>
<p>They reopen Tuesday as normal.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0657))</p>
</text>
